  "details": "This has to be the most minor bug I've ever found and normally I wouldn't even bother reporting this but I've just been on a roll lately so what the heck.\n\n1.) Go to website.\n\n2.) Navigate to your moderations.\n\n3.) View the profile of someone you have blocked.\n\n4.) Now click on your own profile in the top-left.\n\nResult: The 🚫symbol is now on your own profile, suggesting that you've blocked yourself (god I wish, remember when we could friend ourselves?).\n\nObviously this is just a visual bug that will go away by just refreshing or navigating away and back.\n\nAgain, absolutely tiny bug, but there ya go, lol.\n\nMS Edge in case that's relevant (yes I'm crazy don't @ me).",
